  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">Bed<span style=\"color:#999\">Wars</span></span> 地图</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">洞穴</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">作者：<span style=\"color:#800000\">KronixLP &amp; Kazeio<br></span></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">免费使用！如果你使用此地图，请记得将服务器IP发给我！<span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>Discord：</strong>KronixLP#9308 <br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\">你可以将此地图用于你的小游戏服务器！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">模式：BedWars </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span>推荐配置：</span>支持 1x 至 4x4 队伍规模</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">坐标：0 64 0</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">兼容版本：1.7及以上所有版本</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">4个出生岛</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">4个铁岛</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">1个金岛（中间）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">本地图最初按照原版 BedWars 的<span style=\"color:#fc0\">金</span>、<span style=\"color:#999\">铁</span>、<span style=\"color:#930\">铜</span>资源进行设计。你也可以将其更改为<span style=\"color:#3cc\">钻石</span>、<span style=\"color:#808080\">铁 </span>和<span style=\"color:#fc0\">金</span>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S-mEb3_vSiM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/project/2021/620/13824520_l.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"450\"></p>",
